## The bazaar's one claim, with its set padded on purpose: the claim reads
## only where the player is, so none of the eight wares can bear on it. That
## is what the compiler's finding is for.

claims
  needs rooms: the Arcade, the Lamp Stall, the Back Lane
  needs things: the fig, the plum, the ribbon, the thimble, the comb, the wick, the flint, the snuffer
  needs verbs: take, drop

  never the shopper reaches the Back Lane
    the player is in the Back Lane
end claims
